BPM 60

// Measure 1
NOTE G+3 3

// Measure 2
NOTE A5 0.5
NOTE G3 4

// Measure 3
NOTE G+3 3

// Measure 4
NOTE G#5 1
NOTE G3 4

// Other supported accidentals, including octave boundaries
NOTE C-4 1
NOTE C#+4 1
NOTE Cb-4 1
NOTE B##3 1
NOTE Cbb4 1
TUNINGA4 442
TRANSPOSE 0.25
CHORD (G+3 C-4 C#+4 Cb-4 B##3 Cbb4) 2
